WEBVTT

00:00:38.039 --> 00:00:42.210
Damned Turan witch! Absolutely unforgivable!

00:00:42.460 --> 00:00:44.170
She <i>will</i> pay for this!

00:00:44.420 --> 00:00:46.214
But how...?!

00:00:46.464 --> 00:00:48.758
We are without our Goddess now.

00:00:49.008 --> 00:00:52.720
We've lost our wings, and a sky to defend...

00:00:52.970 --> 00:00:55.348
They're all dead...!

00:00:58.100 --> 00:01:01.771
You seem to be at a loss.

00:01:06.817 --> 00:01:08.903
You're from the Federation!

00:01:09.153 --> 00:01:12.156
What is a Federation soldier doing here?!

00:01:12.406 --> 00:01:14.909
What do you want?!

00:01:15.159 --> 00:01:18.496
I'm here for but one reason...

00:01:18.746 --> 00:01:21.290
lam the same as you.

00:01:23.334 --> 00:01:26.796
Your eyes... You're from Chaos!

00:01:27.046 --> 00:01:31.092
Yes. I'm the last surviving Chaosian.

00:01:31.342 --> 00:01:35.805
All the others died fighting your squadron...

00:01:37.348 --> 00:01:41.227
So, you've come for revenge?

00:01:41.477 --> 00:01:45.564
No. Our enemy is someone else.

00:01:46.649 --> 00:01:52.196
I can give you the chance to fight another day.

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:58.869
<i>Soko ni nani ga aru toshite mo</i>

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:07.545
<i>Mikai no ryouiki e kimi to</i>

00:02:15.803 --> 00:02:23.853
<i>Mijikai yume wo miteta ima</i>

00:02:24.103 --> 00:02:28.482
<i>Are wa kimi no senaka</i>

00:02:28.733 --> 00:02:34.655
<i>Kako? Mirai?</i>

00:02:34.905 --> 00:02:45.416
<i>Furikitte iru meetaa no hari wo mushi shite</i>

00:02:45.666 --> 00:02:48.544
<i>Oikaze to kanjou no muku hou e</i>

00:02:48.794 --> 00:02:54.717
<i>Habataku tabi kizukasareru</i>

00:02:54.967 --> 00:03:00.264
<i>Nido to deaenai sora ga aru koto</i>

00:03:00.514 --> 00:03:05.770
<i>Sore demo tobitatsu nara</i>

00:03:06.020 --> 00:03:12.568
<i>Kimi no tsubasa ni naru watashi ga</i>

00:03:46.977 --> 00:03:51.315
Thank goodness!
Thank goodness you're both all right!

00:03:51.565 --> 00:03:53.067
You too, Mom!

00:03:53.317 --> 00:03:55.653
I'm so glad you're all safe!

00:04:19.635 --> 00:04:23.806
The Federation had just looked
the other way this entire time.

00:04:24.056 --> 00:04:27.726
They could've wiped us out
anytime they wanted.

00:04:36.485 --> 00:04:41.657
I guess being the pride of the sky
was nothing but a fantasy...

00:04:47.705 --> 00:04:48.956
Why...?

00:04:49.206 --> 00:04:52.626
All we want to do is fly...

00:04:55.004 --> 00:04:56.547
Oh, yeah!

00:04:56.797 --> 00:04:59.675
Atamora has a message for you, Princess.

00:04:59.925 --> 00:05:06.056
He says you can use all our remaining
ships and people as you like.

00:05:06.307 --> 00:05:07.600
All right, Atamora!

00:05:07.850 --> 00:05:12.563
Are you sure? I'm completely powerless now...

00:05:12.813 --> 00:05:16.275
Kartoffel has decided to place its hope in you.

00:05:16.525 --> 00:05:19.653
If anyone can pull this off, it's you!

00:05:19.904 --> 00:05:21.572
Thank you.

00:05:21.822 --> 00:05:27.953
L-- no, Turan-- will never forget
the friendship you have shown.

00:05:28.204 --> 00:05:30.164
Loosen up, Millia!

00:05:30.414 --> 00:05:32.791
Let's just try our hardest again!

00:05:33.042 --> 00:05:35.294
I won't let your kindness go to waste.

00:05:35.544 --> 00:05:38.297
<i>I will</i> defeat the Federation

00:05:38.547 --> 00:05:42.134
and, for defiling the Exiles and the Grand Lake,

00:05:42.384 --> 00:05:44.178
I will slay Luscinia and Liliana!

00:05:46.138 --> 00:05:48.516
Wh-Whoa, that's a bit extreme, Princess...

00:05:48.766 --> 00:05:50.976
--Rig ht?
--Y-Yeah...

00:05:51.227 --> 00:05:54.313
Getting straight down to business,
I'd like to borrow several Vespas.

00:05:54.563 --> 00:05:57.608
The Anshar, the Federation's
1st Fleet flagship, is undergoing repairs.

00:05:57.858 --> 00:06:00.486
I want to recover it and use it
for ad-hoc transportation.

00:06:00.736 --> 00:06:03.948
--Sure, if that's what you want.
--Thank you.

00:06:09.411 --> 00:06:12.289
What's gotten into the princess?

00:06:12.540 --> 00:06:15.042
She's been like that a while now.

00:06:35.896 --> 00:06:39.650
The 1st Fleet has just arrived.

00:06:39.900 --> 00:06:44.613
I offer my deepest apologies
for missing the attack on Glacies.

00:06:44.863 --> 00:06:48.284
Think nothing of it. Your turn
to shine is yet to come.

00:06:51.370 --> 00:06:54.456
At long last, we've reached this northern land.

00:06:55.499 --> 00:07:00.129
How long it's been. Ten years, is it?

00:07:00.379 --> 00:07:04.925
I would not be here today had
it not been for your support.

00:07:05.175 --> 00:07:09.054
Once more, I thank you from the
bottom of my heart, Admiral Sadri.

00:07:09.305 --> 00:07:12.516
I merely provided some assistance, that's all.

00:07:12.766 --> 00:07:16.020
You've done well leading the Federation this far.

00:07:16.270 --> 00:07:17.896
Thank you.

00:07:19.440 --> 00:07:22.067
How long will it take to rebuild our forces?

00:07:22.318 --> 00:07:25.654
We can make the 1st Fleet our
primary force for the time being,

00:07:25.904 --> 00:07:29.742
but it will take roughly one week
to resupply and reequip the 3rd Fleet.

00:07:29.992 --> 00:07:35.247
The heavily damaged 2nd and 4th Fleets
can be repaired behind them,

00:07:35.497 --> 00:07:38.250
but will require a full month's time.

00:07:38.500 --> 00:07:42.755
Your reconnaissance has shown that
Anatoray is lacking military might

00:07:43.005 --> 00:07:45.799
with the Silvius now out of the picture.

00:07:46.050 --> 00:07:50.220
The 1st and 3rd Fleets alone should
have no trouble subduing them.

00:07:51.430 --> 00:07:53.682
I see you're still as impatient as ever.

00:07:55.184 --> 00:07:56.935
Forgive me.

00:07:59.229 --> 00:08:02.983
If only they would give up and
surrender after seeing this...

00:08:03.233 --> 00:08:06.945
Unfortunately, they don't
appear to be so reasonable.

00:08:09.490 --> 00:08:13.619
Then we will begin our assault
on Anatoray one week from now.

00:08:13.869 --> 00:08:15.621
I leave the preparations to you.

00:08:15.871 --> 00:08:17.790
Gloria, Augusta.

00:08:19.541 --> 00:08:20.668
Where are you going?

00:08:20.918 --> 00:08:22.961
I'll return in time for the invasion.

00:08:23.212 --> 00:08:26.674
I have a reason for coming this far north.

00:08:26.924 --> 00:08:28.425
Then...?!

00:08:36.684 --> 00:08:39.353
The premier is going off on his own?!

00:08:39.603 --> 00:08:43.023
Yes. In the meantime, I am in charge

00:08:43.273 --> 00:08:45.901
of the occupation forces in Glacies
and its interim government.

00:08:46.151 --> 00:08:48.070
What is the meaning of this?!

00:08:48.320 --> 00:08:51.240
Why would the premier suddenly leave now?!

00:08:51.490 --> 00:08:54.284
Is there something more important
than Glacies and Anatoray?!

00:08:54.535 --> 00:08:56.495
There's no sense in prying, firang.

00:08:56.745 --> 00:09:02.084
If the premier says it's important,
then it's indeed important.

00:09:02.334 --> 00:09:05.045
I myself do not know the details.

00:09:05.295 --> 00:09:08.757
But the premier did say something once...

00:09:10.968 --> 00:09:15.264
He said there is only one thing
that can usher in true world peace,

00:09:15.514 --> 00:09:18.684
and that it must be obtained, even if
it means eliminating every obstacle.

00:09:21.437 --> 00:09:23.021
I refuse to accept this!

00:09:23.272 --> 00:09:25.149
Simmer down, will you?

00:09:25.399 --> 00:09:27.401
World peace?

00:09:27.651 --> 00:09:31.947
That's what we've been
fighting for all this time!

00:09:32.197 --> 00:09:35.033
We've shed much blood,
and suffered greatly ourselves...

00:09:35.284 --> 00:09:38.620
Yet he still needs more?!

00:09:40.956 --> 00:09:45.669
Whatever it is, it must be important
to the world he believes in.

00:09:46.962 --> 00:09:49.131
And what world is that?

00:09:49.381 --> 00:09:51.216
Beats me.

00:09:51.467 --> 00:09:55.888
But there's no question that he's
led the Federation all this time

00:09:56.138 --> 00:09:59.141
with true selflessness.

00:09:59.391 --> 00:10:03.353
That's why he has such avid
support from the citizens.

00:10:05.105 --> 00:10:07.441
And this is what we have to show for it?!

00:10:07.691 --> 00:10:09.777
Now you have qualms?

00:10:10.027 --> 00:10:13.489
The Exile was already used against Turan.

00:10:15.282 --> 00:10:18.994
This was my first time witnessing its descent.

00:10:19.244 --> 00:10:22.498
Ah. And that's unnerved you, huh?

00:10:22.748 --> 00:10:24.750
Death is death.

00:10:25.000 --> 00:10:30.464
Whether you're beheaded by sword,
pulverized by cannon fire,

00:10:30.714 --> 00:10:33.592
or destroyed by an Exile
alongside the rest of your city...

00:10:33.842 --> 00:10:38.764
...the end result is the same
for all casualties of war.

00:10:39.014 --> 00:10:40.474
Even so...

00:10:41.725 --> 00:10:44.061
ls there really justness in this?

00:10:58.617 --> 00:11:00.953
Yeah, you do have a point...

00:11:01.203 --> 00:11:06.416
The situation is probably
beyond us ordinary people now.

00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:13.549
Who knows what our leader
sees beyond all of this...

00:11:13.799 --> 00:11:17.970
Boy, this country is cold.

00:11:32.734 --> 00:11:35.696
Princess Millia! Please cheer up!

00:11:35.946 --> 00:11:39.533
The people of Kartoffel
will never abandon Turan!

00:11:41.285 --> 00:11:43.704
Is it me, or have you lost weight?

00:11:43.954 --> 00:11:46.540
Be sure you're getting enough to eat!

00:11:50.627 --> 00:11:55.757
Wow, it sounds like Princess Millia
has grown fond of potato pancakes!

00:11:56.008 --> 00:11:59.720
She even made some for Pam's birthday.

00:11:59.970 --> 00:12:02.014
All on her own, even though she's a princess!

00:12:02.264 --> 00:12:04.558
That's really something!

00:12:04.808 --> 00:12:09.980
Princess Millia has it tough too.
She needs all the support you can give.

00:12:10.230 --> 00:12:11.690
Yeah.

00:12:20.282 --> 00:12:21.617
Oh...

00:12:21.867 --> 00:12:23.785
I'm glad you're all right.

00:12:35.339 --> 00:12:37.007
Sister...

00:12:38.091 --> 00:12:39.509
Sister!

00:12:39.760 --> 00:12:43.388
Stop!

00:12:45.849 --> 00:12:47.726
Millia.

00:12:50.103 --> 00:12:51.563
Want one?

00:12:52.981 --> 00:12:54.733
Not right now.

00:12:54.983 --> 00:12:56.735
Oh.

00:13:07.496 --> 00:13:12.084
Say, Fritz and the gang are
prepping things so we can leave.

00:13:12.334 --> 00:13:15.921
After we get the Anshar back,
what do you say we visit Anatoray first?

00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:21.009
It might take a while, though,
since it's supposedly far to the east.

00:13:21.259 --> 00:13:24.179
I bet we'll find out what
happened to the Silvius, too.

00:13:24.429 --> 00:13:27.766
So let's start by finding the others
and seeing if they're okay...

00:13:28.016 --> 00:13:30.560
<i>I will</i> partner with Anatoray, of course.

00:13:30.811 --> 00:13:33.397
I absolutely need their military might.

00:13:33.647 --> 00:13:36.149
--But we've no time to--
--Millia.

00:13:36.400 --> 00:13:39.569
Don't talk about the people
of Anatoray as "military might."

00:13:41.989 --> 00:13:43.156
I'm sorry...

00:13:43.407 --> 00:13:45.534
Oh, no, it's just...

00:13:45.784 --> 00:13:48.578
It seems like you're trying to carry
this entire burden all by yourself.

00:13:48.829 --> 00:13:53.792
Of course I am.
I'm Liliana Turan's sister, after all.

00:13:54.835 --> 00:13:57.212
But Luscinia is controlling her...

00:13:57.462 --> 00:13:59.715
She wasn't under anyone's control!

00:13:59.965 --> 00:14:03.510
No, even if she had been...

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:07.889
She's used the Exile twice now.
It's my responsibility to stop her.

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:08.932
But...!

00:14:09.182 --> 00:14:13.812
Please, Fam! This is something I have to do!

00:14:14.062 --> 00:14:17.232
5° You're willing to kill Princess Lily?!

00:14:17.482 --> 00:14:19.943
--| am.
--That's crazy!

00:14:20.193 --> 00:14:22.487
She's your one and only sister, you know!

00:14:33.248 --> 00:14:34.916
<i>I'm sorry'.!</i>

00:14:46.511 --> 00:14:50.390
All right! Looks like they'll be
ready to go tomorrow morning!

00:14:50.640 --> 00:14:54.269
I dunno, don't you think
they should hold off a while?

00:14:54.519 --> 00:14:57.522
They've been flying practically non-stop, right?

00:14:57.773 --> 00:15:02.194
You saw Princess Millia.
I doubt she'd go along with that.

00:15:05.030 --> 00:15:08.075
Sorry! I need you right now!

00:15:13.622 --> 00:15:15.123
Giselle!

00:15:19.586 --> 00:15:22.923
What's gotten into you?
This isn't like you at all.

00:15:23.173 --> 00:15:25.175
I'm sorry...

00:15:25.425 --> 00:15:27.761
Is it Princess Millia?

00:15:28.011 --> 00:15:29.763
Yeah.

00:15:30.013 --> 00:15:31.973
Sis!

00:15:32.224 --> 00:15:34.434
Fam is calling for you!

00:15:37.854 --> 00:15:41.358
Sheesh, you guys just never get enough!
You really are Vespa junkies!

00:15:41.608 --> 00:15:44.694
Shut up! If you don't like it,
let's see you take her on!

00:15:44.945 --> 00:15:48.156
Forget that. I'm not getting involved.

00:15:48.406 --> 00:15:50.826
All set! Ready when you are!

00:15:51.076 --> 00:15:52.953
We're ready, too!

00:15:56.790 --> 00:15:57.833
Okay, here we go!

00:15:58.083 --> 00:15:59.042
Three!

00:15:59.292 --> 00:16:00.127
Two!

00:16:00.377 --> 00:16:01.378
One!

00:16:01.628 --> 00:16:03.088
<i>Go'.!</i>

00:16:14.516 --> 00:16:16.309
Oh!

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:18.436
She's at it again!

00:16:18.687 --> 00:16:20.397
She's always been like this.

00:16:20.647 --> 00:16:22.566
She always challenges whoever she can find

00:16:22.816 --> 00:16:26.111
to a race whenever she gets upset.

00:16:30.991 --> 00:16:34.911
Better pick up the pace unless
you wanna eat our dust, Birdbrain!

00:16:35.162 --> 00:16:36.288
Ooh, I'll show you!

00:16:36.538 --> 00:16:39.833
Fam. Our engine's at maximum.

00:16:40.083 --> 00:16:42.752
Sorry for dragging you into this, Gisey!

00:16:43.003 --> 00:16:47.716
Not at all. I felt like flying today, too!

00:16:47.966 --> 00:16:50.844
Great! Let's punch it!

00:16:59.978 --> 00:17:01.479
See ya!

00:17:02.981 --> 00:17:04.608
Darn you, Birdbrain!

00:17:04.858 --> 00:17:09.446
Well, she was on the Silvius a while.
It's only natural she'd improve!

00:17:09.696 --> 00:17:12.282
We've been through a hell
of a lot too, you know!

00:17:12.532 --> 00:17:14.242
Let's go!

00:17:19.623 --> 00:17:21.750
It's a great match!

00:17:22.000 --> 00:17:23.960
It's like the Grand Race...

00:17:30.926 --> 00:17:33.595
<i>That's how I wanted it to</i> be...

00:17:35.013 --> 00:17:38.600
<i>I wanted to make everyone
smile and be happy...</i>

00:17:38.850 --> 00:17:44.564
<i>I wanted everyone to smile.
Friends, strangers... Everyone!</i>

00:17:48.526 --> 00:17:50.153
But...

00:18:04.834 --> 00:18:06.836
You can do it!

00:18:15.637 --> 00:18:17.889
It's beautiful...

00:18:18.139 --> 00:18:20.850
Time to show you who's boss!

00:18:21.101 --> 00:18:22.602
Fan'!

00:18:31.695 --> 00:18:33.154
We're behind!

00:18:38.326 --> 00:18:42.122
Fritz isn't half-bad! He just
might hold on to the lead now!

00:18:42.372 --> 00:18:45.083
No. Fam will win.

00:18:45.333 --> 00:18:46.334
Huh?

00:18:46.584 --> 00:18:51.548
Fam makes me believe. She always does.

00:18:57.220 --> 00:18:59.014
I will slay Liliana!

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:03.184
<i>I'm helpless to do anything now!</i>

00:19:08.273 --> 00:19:11.067
Fam is right.

00:19:11.318 --> 00:19:12.986
I don't...

00:19:14.738 --> 00:19:16.406
I don't want to...

00:19:21.119 --> 00:19:23.580
<i>That's the only thing I want...!</i>

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.957
<i>I just want people to smile!</i>

00:19:28.084 --> 00:19:34.591
I don't want to have to kill my sister either...!

00:19:54.819 --> 00:19:56.654
Dammit...

00:19:56.905 --> 00:19:59.240
Dammit...!

00:19:59.491 --> 00:20:02.494
Dammit!

00:20:29.104 --> 00:20:30.647
What happened to you?!

00:20:34.484 --> 00:20:36.444
Oh, Millia! Why are your eyes all red?

00:20:36.694 --> 00:20:39.989
Why are <i>yours?</i> That isn't like you!

00:20:40.240 --> 00:20:43.868
I'm allowed to get sad sometimes too, you know.

00:20:44.119 --> 00:20:46.204
But why are your eyes all red?

00:20:46.454 --> 00:20:49.499
It's nothing. I just got some dirt in them.

00:20:49.749 --> 00:20:52.085
Then I had dirt in mine, too.

00:20:52.335 --> 00:20:54.295
That's not what you just said!

00:21:10.520 --> 00:21:13.148
Might you be Princess Millia of Turan?

00:21:13.398 --> 00:21:15.984
Yes, I'm Millia.

00:21:17.277 --> 00:21:21.739
I come bearing an urgent
message for Princess Millia.

00:21:21.990 --> 00:21:23.700
For me?

00:21:31.749 --> 00:21:33.460
The seal of Augusta Sari?!

00:21:33.710 --> 00:21:36.629
A-Augusta? As in the Federation's?!

00:21:40.758 --> 00:21:44.554
"Augusta Sire“! is deeply troubled by the
audacity and repeated acts of violence

00:21:44.804 --> 00:21:48.141
perpetrated by Federation
Premier Luscinia Hifez

00:21:48.391 --> 00:21:52.103
and has decided that he shall be
dealt with in the name of the Augusta."

00:21:53.354 --> 00:21:56.107
"Therefore, I offer a truce and a helping hand

00:21:56.357 --> 00:22:03.406
to people of all lands who have suffered
from Luscinia's transgressions.

00:22:03.656 --> 00:22:08.745
I would very much like to ask for
your support, Princess Millia of Turan..."

00:22:11.873 --> 00:22:13.500
What the heck?

00:22:13.750 --> 00:22:18.171
The Federation's Augusta has
gotten rid of Premier Luscinia?!

00:22:18.421 --> 00:22:20.590
Sire“! is too young to be behind this.

00:22:21.716 --> 00:22:27.222
Someone within the Federation
has risen in revolt against Luscinia!

00:22:31.017 --> 00:22:36.606
<i>Sora wa dore hodo takai no darou</i>

00:22:36.856 --> 00:22:42.654
<i>Kaze wa dore hodo tsuyoi no darou</i>

00:22:42.904 --> 00:22:48.493
<i>Mizu wa dore hodo sunderu darou</i>

00:22:48.743 --> 00:22:55.792
<i>Kimi no mune no naka dewa</i>

00:22:57.001 --> 00:23:08.471
<i>Namida uketomeru
kimi no te no hira ni itsuka naritai</i>

00:23:08.721 --> 00:23:20.567
<i>Onaji kanashimi onaji kuuki wo wakeaitai</i>

00:23:20.817 --> 00:23:26.406
<i>lma hashiridasu fune no saki wo</i>

00:23:26.656 --> 00:23:35.206
<i>Tamerawazu kimi no muki e susumete</i>

00:23:35.456 --> 00:23:41.170
<i>Kaze no umi de hobashira wo tate</i>

00:23:41.421 --> 00:23:46.968
<i>Kumo no nami wo suberihajimeyou</i>

00:23:47.218 --> 00:23:52.724
<i>Tooi hoshi wo konpasu ni shite</i>

00:23:52.974 --> 00:24:00.648
<i>Kimi to mezasu kanata e</i>

00:24:03.359 --> 00:24:05.153
<i>We've never been to the
Ades Federation before...</i>

00:24:05.403 --> 00:24:08.781
<i>Everyone there really
cherishes the Augusta, right?</i>

00:24:09.032 --> 00:24:11.075
<i>That's because she's so young.</i>

00:24:11.326 --> 00:24:13.161
<i>I wonder what kind of place she fives in!</i>

00:24:13.411 --> 00:24:15.580
<i>I bet it's a super luxurious royal palace!</i>

00:24:15.830 --> 00:24:17.332
<i>That's not what I hear...</i>

00:24:17.582 --> 00:24:20.752
<i>And maybe she'll welcome us
with lots of fancy food!</i>

00:24:21.002 --> 00:24:22.837
<i>Just thinking about it makes me drool...</i>

00:24:23.087 --> 00:24:23.963
<i>I can't wait!</i>

00:24:24.213 --> 00:24:27.467
<i>Come on, you two! We're not
going there to have fun, you know!</i>
